Subject: [PATCH] fix(block-entities): translate moving and extended pistons

Bedrock stores piston extension in the PistonArm block entity and the carried block in a separate MovingBlock entity. Translate both into Java block states and moving-piston data so the client can render the animation and its carried block. The mapping follows fields captured from a native 1.26.51 server and uses the existing block-state sanitizer for carried blocks.
